---
import { appPath, assetPath, shapeitIconPath } from '../lib/urls';

const loginUrl = appPath('/login');
const howUrl = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}#how-it-works`;
const heroBgUrl = assetPath('hero-bg.png');
---

<section class="shapeit-hero relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="shapeit-hero-bg" aria-hidden="true">
    <img
      src={heroBgUrl}
      alt=""
      class="shapeit-hero-bg-img"
      width={1920}
      height={1080}
      loading="eager"
      decoding="sync"
    />
  </div>
  <div class="shapeit-hero-veil" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto flex min-h-[88vh] max-w-6xl flex-col justify-end px-4 pb-16 pt-28 sm:px-6 sm:pb-24 sm:pt-32 lg:justify-center lg:pb-28">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="shapeit-icon-frame shapeit-icon-frame--hero-badge">
          <img src={shapeitIconPath} alt="" class="shapeit-brand-icon" width="40" height="40" />
        </span>
        <p class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-paper sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl">
          ShapeIt
          <span class="mt-0.5 block text-sm font-medium tracking-[0.12em] text-mint-bright sm:text-base">シェイプイット</span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <h1 class="font-display mt-6 text-[1.75rem] font-bold leading-[1.35] tracking-tight text-paper sm:mt-8 sm:text-4xl sm:leading-[1.2] lg:text-5xl" data-jp-heading>
        みんなで気づき、<br />みんなで良くする。
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-lg text-base leading-relaxed text-paper/80 sm:text-lg" data-jp-wrap>
        バグも使いにくさも、スクショ一枚と一言で記録。AIが整理し、チームの改善サイクルにつなげます。
      </p>

      <div class="mt-9 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
        <a
          href={loginUrl}
          class="group inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-mint px-8 py-4 text-base font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-mint/30 transition-all hover:bg-mint-bright"
        >
          無料で始める
          <svg class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M3 10a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75h10.638L10.23 5.29a.75.75 0 1 1 1.04-1.08l5.5 5.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.08l-5.5 5.25a.75.75 0 1 1-1.04-1.08l4.158-3.96H3.75A.75.75 0 0 1 3 10z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a
          href={howUrl}
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-paper/30 bg-paper/10 px-8 py-4 text-base font-semibold text-paper backdrop-blur-sm transition-all hover:border-paper/50 hover:bg-paper/20"
        >
          使い方を見る
        </a>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-6 text-xs text-paper/55 sm:text-sm" data-jp-wrap>
        投稿は中央値10秒 · 分類はAI任せ · Googleログインで開始
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .shapeit-hero {
    isolation: isolate;
    background: #0b1320;
  }

  .shapeit-hero-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .shapeit-hero-bg-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 35%;
    animation: shapeit-hero-drift 28s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
  }

  .shapeit-hero-veil {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    background:
      linear-gradient(105deg, rgba(11, 19, 32, 0.92) 0%, rgba(11, 19, 32, 0.72) 42%, rgba(11, 19, 32, 0.35) 68%, rgba(11, 19, 32, 0.55) 100%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(11, 19, 32, 0.25) 0%, transparent 35%, rgba(11, 19, 32, 0.75) 100%);
  }

  @keyframes shapeit-hero-drift {
    0% {
      transform: scale(1.05) translate(0, 0);
    }
    100% {
      transform: scale(1.12) translate(-2%, -1%);
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .shapeit-hero-bg-img {
      animation: none;
    }
  }
</style>
